{
  "slug": "alation",
  "name": "Alation",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude plugin for the Alation platform. Query data products, explore catalogs, automate workflows, curate metadata, and configure AI agents — all through natural language.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `ask` (Use when the user asks a data question, wants to run a query against a data product, chat…), `automate` (Use when the user wants to create, run, schedule, or debug automated workflows and recurring jobs), `configure` (Use when the user wants to create, modify, or manage AI agents, custom tools, LLM configurations, or data…), `curate` (Use when the user wants to create, update, or manage data products, publish or unpublish data products to…), `explore` (Use when the user wants to discover, find, or browse data assets in the Alation catalog, data products,…), `setup` (Guide the user through creating and validating their credentials.local file for connecting to Alation), `using-alation` (Injected at session start)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install alation@claude-community` from `Alation/alation-plugins`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 7,
    "hook": 1
  },
